# Source files are text: force a textual diff even if a stray control byte
# would otherwise make git call the blob binary and hide the diff from review.
# Paired with scripts/check-no-nul-in-source.py, which stops the byte landing.
*.rs    diff
*.ts    diff
*.tsx   diff
*.js    diff
*.jsx   diff
*.mjs   diff
*.cjs   diff
*.json  diff
*.toml  diff
*.md    diff
*.css   diff
*.html  diff
*.yml   diff
*.yaml  diff
*.sh    diff
*.py    diff
*.nix   diff
